# Copy this to $TRADING_MT5_HOME/.env (default: ~/.tradingmt5/.env).
# MT5_MCP_API_KEY: the per-client key the MT5 terminal's native MCP server
# expects as `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Get it from Tools > Options > MCP
# in the terminal UI — NOT from Config/assistant.ini (that key is unrelated,
# confirmed by direct comparison). GOTCHA: the running MCP listener only
# reads this key at terminal startup — after generating/changing it in
# Options, fully restart MT5 (kill terminal64.exe, relaunch) before it will
# authenticate; saving the dialog alone does not hot-reload it.
# Never share this file.
MT5_MCP_API_KEY=
